 R←Test_Misc_007(stopFlag batchFlag);⎕TRAP;bits
⍝ Exercise `Is64Bit`
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '∘∘∘ ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')
 R←T._Failed

 bits←##.HashPasswords.Is64Bit
 →T.PassesIf 0=⍴⍴bits                                ⍝ Must be a scalar: `Init_SHA256` picks with `(1+Is64Bit)⊃`
 →T.PassesIf bits∊0 1
 →T.PassesIf bits≡'-64'≡¯3↑1⊃'#'⎕WG'APLVersion'
 →T.PassesIf bits∨'Mac'≢∆OS                          ⍝ There is no 32-bit Dyalog for macOS

 R←T._OK
